<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez sets China Res call warrants.</title>
<headline>Indosuez sets China Res call warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Wednesday it proposed to issue 150 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Resources Enterprise Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$14.55     PREMIUM	   25.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.3688    GEARING	   4.0X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	11.DEC.97    MIN EXER LOT    20,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT  HK$14.55</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
